        "id": 18914
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-28T19:23:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a clean way for us to detect if, for whatever reason, this unlikely path does occur and warn accordingly? I suppose it may be overkill to iterate over `pCopyDstLayouts` to see if that layout is actually present... I just don\u0027t like depending upon this if it isn\u0027t in the spec. Do you know if there\u0027s a VVL warning that would catch this?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 277,
        "startChar": 96,
        "endLine": 281,
        "endChar": 100
      },
      "revId": "0b0801bc67a1f56543aad401415ca32396190d9f",
