    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "faf2c65e_1c568c68",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/vk/VulkanCaps.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 281,
      "author": {
        "id": 20444
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-02T16:46:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We _do_ check if the layout is present. That\u0027s done below, and yes VVL would catch it if we use a layout that\u0027s not supported:\n\n```\n        // vkTransitionImageLayout from this extension can be used to transition between image\n        // layouts on the host, with the allowed old and new layouts found in pCopySrcLayouts and\n        // pCopyDstLayouts respectively.  The GENERAL layout is required to be found in both.  Skia\n        // has two use cases for this function; initialization (UNDEFINED-\u003eGENERAL) and after\n        // texture updates (GENERAL-\u003eSHADER_READ_ONLY, per Recorder::update*BackendTexture).\n        props-\u003efHicHasShaderReadOnlyDstLayout \u003d\n                std::find(props-\u003efHic.pCopyDstLayouts,\n                          props-\u003efHic.pCopyDstLayouts + props-\u003efHic.copyDstLayoutCount,\n                          VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_SHADER_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL);\n```\n\nFWIW, I noticed that ARM drivers (surprisingly) don\u0027t advertise support for this layout, but they absolutely do and should. I\u0027ve notified them about it, but anyway the issue will resolve itself with VK_KHR_unified_image_layouts which requires that all compatible layouts be advertised as supporting HIC.\n\nFor now, I\u0027m not in a hurry to implement the fall back; by the time we figure out where to best use HIC in Android / or how to add support for compressed formats there, the ARM driver should catch up.",
      "parentUuid": "9ac1aca6_5d5dd8c4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 277,
        "startChar": 96,
        "endLine": 281,
        "endChar": 100
      },
      "revId": "0b0801bc67a1f56543aad401415ca32396190d9f",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
